WEBVTT

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.760
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.760
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:50.580
MAAM'S TURMOIL

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:53.800
Dai! Run!

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.340
He's paralyzed!

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.220
Stop!

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:08.850
Dai!

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:12.830
Why did you shoot Dai?!

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:14.150
Calm down! Look!

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:22.570
I can move!

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:24.870
I can move my body!

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:30.290
Damn you!

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.260
How can you move?!

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.650
What did you do?!

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:42.590
That was Tingle.
A spell that cures paralysis and numbness.

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:45.510
I shot him with Tingle to help him.

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:53.150
We were interrupted...

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:58.030
but you merely
extended your life a few moments!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:00.670
Dai!

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:03.050
Dammit, what is that weapon?!

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:05.240
I know! Can you cast Crack?!

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:08.870
Sure! My Ice-type spells
are unparalleled...

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:11.040
Forget the bragging!
Load it into this bullet!

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:12.750
Huh? How?!

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:16.170
Press the stone at the top
and cast the spell!

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:17.360
Hurry!

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:18.380
All right...!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.800
Crackle!

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.520
Die!

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:35.310
Now!

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.120
The sun?!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:51.410
How's that?!

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:59.920
You dare scar my face...
No, my pride!

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:02.720
Remember this, Dai!

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:07.600
I swear I'll kill you! I swear it!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.660
Dai! Are you okay?!

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:16.480
Popp...

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.540
Popp, how could you ditch me?

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:21.050
Um, that was...

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:23.450
So you really did abandon him!

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:31.080
This is my Magic Bullet Gun.
It was a gift from Master Avan.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:35.230
You load spells
into the Magic Bullets and fire them.

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:38.940
Huh. So it's shoots
attack and heal spells.

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:42.070
Oh, so you're
a student of Master Avan, too.

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:43.480
That explains your strength.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:44.340
How do you feel?

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:48.860
Much better.
Your Midheal is better than Grampa's.

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:52.310
Hey, could I get a heal spell, too?

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.180
Here! Medicinal herbs!

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:57.330
What the hell!
What's this difference in treatment?!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.580
The difference between
a Hero and a coward!

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.070
W-What?!

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.700
These clouds bode ill tidings.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:10.240
I hope nothing's happened to Dai.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:17.250
What is this terrible presence?!

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:22.560
<i>You must be Brass, the Lump Shaman.</i>

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:25.130
The Dark Army?! Impossible!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:30.970
This island is protected
by Sir Avan's Magic Circle!

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:36.370
Even when Hadlar breached it,
there was a huge tremor!

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:39.310
How could anyone come in so easily?!

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:47.070
<i>With my Mystic Magic Power
it's mere child's play.</i>

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:48.700
Who are you?!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:52.880
I am the Mystic Bishop Zaboera.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:55.210
Legion Commander of the Mystic Legion,

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:58.420
LEGION COMMANDER OF THE MYSTIC LEGION
MYSTIC BISHOP ZABOERA

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:58.420
one of the Six Legions of the Dark Lord.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:04.920
Gomechan!

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.570
Maam! Are you okay?!

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:13.120
Of course she is!
Maam's tough like a monster!

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.320
A monster?

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:16.700
I-I mean, she's like a saint!

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.640
Very good.

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.870
Maam, who are they?

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:24.400
They're nobody suspicious, Elder.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.360
They're Heroes fighting the Dark Army.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:28.820
They are?

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:34.580
Come to think of it, Gomechan was
the only one who never went crazy.

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:38.580
So your name's Gomechan!
I'm glad you were reunited!

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:45.960
Maybe Gomechan has some power
that blocks the Dark Lord's influence.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:49.130
I'm just glad we're reunited.
Thank you, Maam.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.440
You're welcome.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:51.320
Maam.

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:53.050
Oh, Mom!

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:55.100
Huh?

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:58.450
Allow me to introduce my mother, Leira.

00:06:58.450 --> 00:06:59.970
H-Hello.

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:04.210
Mom, these two are
Master Avan's students, too.

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:06.530
Oh, Sir Avan's?

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.760
You know Master Avan?

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:11.110
Of course she does.

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:16.890
Mom and my late father
fought the Dark Lord with Master Avan.

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:17.950
What?!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.660
It was a long time ago.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.040
My husband was a Warrior
and I was a Priest.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.420
<i>Together, we aided Sir Avan.</i>

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:31.800
<i>After the Dark Lord was vanquished
and peace was restored,</i>

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:36.450
Sir Avan visited this village once.

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:40.140
That's when he tutored Maam.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.750
That was four or five years ago.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:46.670
Wow, it's already been that long.

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:49.630
So, is Sir Avan well?

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:51.090
Huh?! Uh, er...

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:52.200
He's fine!

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.220
He's as lively as ever!

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:55.970
<i>Dai...</i>

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:59.910
I see. That's good to hear.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:03.080
You should stay here a while after all.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:06.480
I'd love to hear about Master Avan.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:08.630
Uh, we wouldn't want to intrude.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:11.780
Good idea. Please, stay a while.

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:13.360
We really shouldn't.

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:17.570
Stay! Stay! That way
I get to play with Gomechan again!

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:18.950
I wanna play, too!

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:19.870
Me too!

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:23.480
The whole village welcomes
any student of Sir Avan.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:29.710
Most of the men
have gone to protect Romos Castle.

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:34.050
So the rest of us
protect the village together.

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:36.200
With you in the lead.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:41.750
My father was a Warrior and my mother
a Priest, so I guess I'm a Warrior Priest.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:48.130
Master Avan taught me Healing and
Support-type spells and some martial arts.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.960
But I can't use attack spells...

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.840
So he gave you the Magic Bullet Gun.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:58.260
Yes. At my graduation.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:02.600
I'll never forget that day.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:06.810
What's this?

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:10.360
Your certificate of graduation.
An Insignia of Avan.

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:14.950
With this, anywhere you go,
you're officially a protector of justice.

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:19.510
And this is a present from me.

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:21.200
A present?

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.420
Master, what is this?!

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:32.300
A Magic Bullet Gun. A great weapon
that lets you charge and fire magic.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:36.440
I made it based on research documents...

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:37.490
Master!

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:38.180
Huh?

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:42.220
I don't want this scary item!

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:46.290
I just want to be like Mom and Dad.

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:50.230
I just want to protect
everyone in the village!

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.230
That's all.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:56.950
Maam, you truly are a gentle soul.

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:58.860
But Maam...

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:05.370
there are times when love and kindness
aren't enough to protect people.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:09.530
Just as strength without justice
is powerless,

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:13.500
so too is justice without strength.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:20.300
Besides, not only will this weapon
boost your attack,

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:24.890
but it can save people
with Healing and Support-type spells.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.520
It's all in how you use it.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:29.900
Don't worry.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:37.610
In your hands, this will never
become power without justice.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.450
I guarantee it.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:44.030
Master Avan...

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:49.830
He was a little silly,
but strong and kind.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:53.250
He truly was a wonderful teacher.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.380
Oh man. I suddenly miss him.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:05.220
<i>At first I thought she seemed boorish.</i>

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:12.230
<i>Now that I look at her, Maam's actually...</i>

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:17.530
MAGIC BULLET GUN

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:22.530
BOOM
EXPLOSION-TYPE SPELL

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:35.630
Pathetic! Disciple of Avan or not,
I let that child best me!

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.460
Dammit!

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:40.570
<i>I see you're in a bad mood, Crocodine.</i>

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:42.050
Who dares?!

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.260
<i>Not that I blame you.</i>

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:50.350
<i>Not after some mere children
scarred you so.</i>

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:52.900
Zaboera!

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:58.380
Good to see you, Beast King.

00:11:58.380 --> 00:12:01.490
How did you know of my wound?!

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:07.370
The Heyedra, watchers of the battlefield,
belong to my Mystic Legion.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:11.500
There is nothing I do not know.

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:16.920
And? Have you come to laugh at me?

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:21.470
Learning of your plight,
I've come to offer my aid.

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:23.970
You?! Offer to aid me?!

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:27.640
As a fellow Legion Commander.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:33.950
I should go see the village elder.

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:35.040
What's wrong?

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:38.020
I need to ask him to load
these bullets with attack spells.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:42.300
The elder is
the best spell caster in the village.

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:43.530
Huh.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:48.220
In that case, I'll do it for you.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.260
Really? Thank you!

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:51.790
Sure. Leave it to me.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.720
Congratulations, Maam.

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:57.310
Popp hardly ever does anything for anyone.

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:59.250
Back me up a little, you moron!

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:03.970
Take care of that then.
I'll go prepare dinner.

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:13.980
We can't tell her that Master Avan died.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.230
Yeah.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:18.980
But Master Avan really is amazing.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:24.530
So many people admire him.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:25.740
Yeah.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.700
I should fill these up.

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:30.200
Popp.

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:33.140
I gotta go!

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:34.220
Huh? Where?

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:35.870
Whoa, whoa, whoa, Dai!

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:38.540
What's his problem?

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:44.070
What?! You'd have me use
such a dirty tactic?!

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:48.150
There's no dirty or clean
in defeating an enemy.

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:49.610
Shut up!

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:52.390
I don't need your dirty help!

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:57.120
I'll fight him fair and square and win!

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:59.080
Are you sure?

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:02.940
That boy, Dai, cannot be underestimated.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:07.110
Apparently he cut off Lord Hadlar's hands.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:13.930
Besides, if you should happen to fail

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:18.000
you won't have a seat left
in the Dark Army, Crocodine.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:22.810
Lord Hadlar may be aware of Dai's power,

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:26.800
but what will the other four
Legion Commanders say?

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.450
"So Crocodine, the Beast King,

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:34.720
was a fool who
couldn't even kill a child."

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:36.600
H-How dare you!

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:42.980
It's for your own good. Use this.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:48.450
You wouldn't want to lose
your current position, would you?

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:53.490
It's to defeat Dai.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.580
Take it.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.460
I have a favor to ask!

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:02.600
Dai?

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:05.460
Please train me in magic!

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:11.280
I can't be saying I'm no good at spells
when fighting the Dark Army!

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:15.850
It's true that I am
the best Mage in the village,

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:20.730
but I'm not good enough
to teach a student of Sir Avan.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.110
<i>Magic training?</i>

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:29.320
I was only trained by Master Avan
for three days.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.070
What do you mean?

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:36.910
Elder, you can't let Maam
or her mother know.

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.220
Master is...

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:40.960
Master Avan...

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.750
died.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.140
What?!

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:47.170
He was protecting us from the Dark Army.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:52.340
I have to get stronger!
To avenge Master Avan!

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:55.510
I'm a disciple of Avan!

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.540
You can use this room.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:03.350
-Okay.
-Thank you.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:08.570
Maam's shut herself in her room.
I wonder what's wrong.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:11.320
<i>Master...</i>

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:13.450
<i>Master Avan...</i>

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.200
<i>Master...</i>

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.730
Oh! Looking good this time!

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:26.670
Now cast it forth!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:29.960
Frizz!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:33.380
Another failure!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:34.470
Not yet!

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:37.320
What?!

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:38.180
I did it!

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:41.020
He threw the fireball!

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:42.890
Well done, young Dai!

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:44.730
I did it!

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:48.770
I finally managed to do a spell on my own!

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.250
What does he mean?

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:56.260
Well, sometimes this mark lights up
on his forehead.

00:16:56.260 --> 00:17:01.510
When it does, he gets real strong
and casts amazing spells,

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:03.350
but normally, he can't.

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:04.160
Crack!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.420
He's pretty weird, huh?

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.970
<i>A mark on their forehead... A crest?</i>

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:21.390
<i>The ones who can use
any fighting skill or spell.</i>

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:25.810
<i>I've heard of such a race
of ultimate knights, but...</i>

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:28.150
<i>He couldn't be.</i>

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.110
Frizz!

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:34.190
Okay!

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:40.300
Talk about a forced spell.
You can't call that a success.

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:44.200
Now, now. It just needs to hit his target.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:48.730
He uses ingenuity to overcome weakness.
He's a clever lad.

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:51.730
Okay. I can't get complacent!

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:52.960
Here goes, Dai!

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:57.030
Huh? You're leaving tomorrow?

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:57.720
Yeah.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:01.490
You said you were going to
Romos Castle. What for?

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:03.530
To help the king.

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:06.750
We heard he's being
threatened by monsters.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:07.980
I see.

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:12.000
Maam seems kind of down.

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:15.860
Listen, Dai,
why don't we tell Maam the truth?

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:17.880
Huh? We can't!

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:21.620
But she might decide to join us.

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:27.270
But Maam has her duty
to protect this village.

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:28.980
Even so...

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:29.980
I see.

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:30.580
What?

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:34.420
Popp, you like Maam, don't you?

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:39.640
W-W-What are you talking about?!
W-Why should I like her?!

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:44.070
Liar. You're always staring at her!

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:45.830
I am not! Forget it!

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:48.440
Get to sleep! Goodnight!

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:02.280
Bye-bye, Gomechan!

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.800
Good luck out there.

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:05.700
Yeah.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:11.500
Bye Maam. Thanks for everything.

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:15.840
I'm sorry. I really wanted
to go with you, but...

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:20.570
That's okay. The elder gave us
a map of the forest.

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:21.550
I see.

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:25.320
Goodbye! I promise to come back!

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:27.430
And I'll come, too!

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:30.410
They're good boys.

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:34.770
So young, yet they're
standing up to the Dark Army.

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.150
What's wrong, Maam?

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:43.720
<i>They're both risking their lives
to avenge Master Avan, and yet...</i>

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:45.080
<i>I...</i>

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:46.830
<i>I...</i>

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.750
Maam, go on after them.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.080
Mom?!

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:55.960
You want to help them, don't you?

00:19:56.750 --> 00:20:00.220
Don't worry about us. Go on.

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:01.550
But...

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:07.060
I once left this village, too.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:13.310
After I saw Sir Avan and your father
fighting even when they were wounded.

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:15.670
That's right.

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:19.070
You're my daughter. It's in your blood.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:20.530
Mom...

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:24.800
Maam, don't worry about the village.

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:27.590
I still have strength in me yet.

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:29.600
That's right! Go on!

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:32.600
We'll protect the village!

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.830
Go help Gomechan!

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:37.670
Everyone...

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:40.510
Thank you!

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.680
Is it this way?

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.410
Or this way?

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:50.470
You're like this even with a map?!

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:56.230
Dai! Popp!

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:00.110
Maam?!

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:01.320
Why?

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:04.240
Dai! Popp! I'm coming with you!

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.530
Hooray!

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:09.740
Good for you, Popp.

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.200
W-What are you talking about?!

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:15.890
I just figured she'd be useful in a fight!

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:17.710
Dai, Popp...

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:23.380
if you're both disciples of Avan,
then I'm your senior.

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:28.470
So I'm going to carry on
Master Avan's will and fight, too.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.020
Maam?

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:32.930
Did you...?

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.440
You can tell me on the way.

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:40.270
It's this way!

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:44.110
Come on! Hurry!

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:49.030
I think she's going to be
bossing us around.

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.990
That means she's reliable.

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:55.040
Let's just go!

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:25.940
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:25.940
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:46.670
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:46.670
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:52.810
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:52.810
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:57.480
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:57.480
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:01.690
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:01.690
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:08.150
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:08.150
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:13.990
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:13.990
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:19.290
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:19.290
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:38.730
<i>With their new companion, Maam,
Dai and Popp reach Romos Kingdom.</i>

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:46.030
<i>Meanwhile, seeking revenge on Dai,
Beast King Crocodine attacks with an army.</i>

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:48.650
<i>Fighting his pride as a warrior,</i>

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:52.160
<i>Crocodine appears before Dai
like a furious titan.</i>

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:56.050
<i>Next time on</i>
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:56.050 --> 00:23:58.220
<i>"Furfang Full Assault"</i>

00:23:58.220 --> 00:24:00.290
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
